# The source distribution holds the adapter package, its metadata and the legal files. The tests, their fixtures, the
# runtime (scripts, locks, item sets, manifests), the container files and the published results stay in the repository.
include LICENSE NOTICE THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md README.md pyproject.toml
prune tests
prune runtime
prune container
prune results
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod] .DS_Store
